## Interface: 16001
## Title: Forever Map Link
## Notes: Shows the local 3D map where you are (a tiny coded strip in the top-left corner; /maplink turns it on or off), shows the 3D map's route in the game (on the world map and minimap, as an arrow and as a list of steps), and follows leveling guides written for Guidelime in a window of its own (/maplink guide). Shift-click the world map for a quick waypoint.
## Version: 12
## Group: ForeverMapLink
## OptionalDeps: ShortestPathForever, QuestieDB
## SavedVariables: ForeverMapLinkDB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: ForeverMapLinkCharDB

